b=b1?'- "web": if answering needs the internet (news, weather, prices, scores, facts about the world, places, public people) and their data above does not answer it, a short search query for it, with no personal details from their data; then "reply" can be empty. Otherwise null. Never for their own plans, money, habits or notes.\n':""
